    "detailed_description": "Prione is an open-world, Third-person survival game. It also contains elements of horror, adventure, and puzzle-solving that create a hardcore gaming experience. The game is difficult but not overkill; surviving isn\u2019t supposed to be easy. On your way, you will encounter many mysterious stories, clues, and puzzles leading to various paths that can be explored. Your main objective is to overcome the harsh and brutal wild. Not only will we make a great game, but we will also make it an enjoyable experience for everyone.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFEATURES (NOW)PATCH 1.0.0<br />\r\n* 4K Resolution Support* <br />\r\n* Multiplayer <br />\r\nA large Forest containing mysterious and customizable assets.<br />\r\nSmall, medium, and massive creatures with different agendas.<br />\r\nYou will need your wits and guts to survive the harsh desert.<br />\r\nDay/Night system that affects the player directly.<br />\r\nRandom goals and missions.<br />\r\nHidden and secret loot",
